INT. OFFICE - DAY

JOHN
Did you get the memo?

SARAH
Yes, I filed it.

INT. NIGHTCLUB - NIGHT

Loud music plays. Flashing lights.

MIKE
(yelling)
I can't hear you!

CHLOE
Let's go somewhere else!

DAVE
Wait up!

LISA
Hurry!

EXT. MOUNTAIN BRIDGE - NIGHT

A massive explosion rips through the bridge! A helicopter crashes into the concrete, bursting into flames.

STUNT DOUBLE
Watch out!

Hero leaps over the gap on a stunt wirework harness.
Destruction everywhere. The creature roars from the abyss.

JOHN
We have to jump!

SARAH
It's too far!

CHLOE
No choice!

DAVE
Hold my hand!

LISA
Go go go!

INT. HOSPITAL ROOM - DAY

John wakes up. Sarah is sitting there.

JOHN
What happened?

SARAH
You made it.
